Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.16,0:01:49.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.60,0:01:51.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Scram !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.52,0:01:54.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu !?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.08,0:01:56.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're still alive !?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.88,0:02:02.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.64,0:02:06.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why does he have such an overbearing aura ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.56,0:02:08.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This aura
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:11.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,is something only ancient cultivators could possess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.80,0:02:13.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.96,0:02:15.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're not him !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:16.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.36,0:02:19.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.36,0:02:22.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,which generation Suzaku are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.84,0:02:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 14th generation Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:27.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,On the behalf of Ye Wuyou,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.40,0:02:30.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,this old man won't kill you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.76,0:02:31.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now scram !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:33.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.84,0:02:36.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do you know the name of the first Suzaku ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.08,0:02:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ye Wuyou ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.16,0:02:41.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only Suzaku successors
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:43.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,know that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.36,0:02:46.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,An outsiders couldn't possibly know...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.96,0:02:49.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,His attitude is so overbearing...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:51.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could he be !?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:02:57.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:02:58.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior is leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:03:00.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Leave the 4th soul !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:05.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Forget it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.44,0:03:09.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,you need the 4th soul against the Forsaken Immortal Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.80,0:03:12.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ye Wuyou once saved me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:14.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I'll lend it for 3 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.76,0:03:17.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.36,0:03:19.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:26.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:29.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you guessed my identity,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.84,0:03:32.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,then you must know my rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.88,0:03:33.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.92,0:03:35.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,just leaving like this !?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.60,0:03:42.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior was negligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.64,0:03:44.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,are 2 fingers enough ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:47.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Leave another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:51.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now scram.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:01.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.76,0:04:10.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Possession ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:15.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:44.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little brat, you were about to make a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:45.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,If this old man had his old temper,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.28,0:04:47.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would have killed you instantly !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.80,0:04:52.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who said you could rain !?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.76,0:04:55.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now scatter for me !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.76,0:05:00.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.84,0:05:02.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's going on ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.08,0:05:04.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why did you ask for the 4th soul !?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.81,0:05:06.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,If that brat had noticed something,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:09.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would've had to go back to sleep just after waking up !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:12.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 4th soul can wait until I get a new body
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.76,0:05:14.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,and restore my cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:17.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll storm Mount Suzaku and take it back !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:20.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,May I ask who Senior is ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.08,0:05:21.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.24,0:05:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,can you tell that brat
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:25.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:27.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's Situ Nan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.64,0:05:30.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Situ Nan ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:32.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,2nd generation Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.60,0:05:38.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,No wonder the Suzaku fled...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:41.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Du Tian of the Soul Refining Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.40,0:05:42.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,greets Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:45.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,During the previous war,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.76,0:05:47.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,your 4th ancestor helped us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:50.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you helped Wang Lin to reach Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.36,0:05:51.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,and wake me up,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:53.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little brat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.36,0:05:55.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,although your lifespan is ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.28,0:05:56.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I promise you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.64,0:05:58.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,that when I recover my cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:06:01.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll reclaim your 4th ancestor's soul
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.48,0:06:04.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,and restore the Soul Refining Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:06.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:10.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,your prediction worked...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.68,0:06:13.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}The clouds and the mist cannot hide a thousand mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:13.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will not become a sinner of our sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.40,0:06:18.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}This wish has remained unchanged for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.48,0:06:17.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can face you with pride now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:19.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and our master,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:23.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}The Dao can be condensed into a single thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:23.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,and all of the Ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:29.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}The past flashes before my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:29.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}as I turn around to let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:28.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little friend Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.32,0:06:30.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,this old man has one last request.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.04,0:06:35.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}Resolutely carrying the torch forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:35.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will condense my memory
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.96,0:06:37.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,inside the Soul Flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:39.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keep it safe for me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.00,0:06:42.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,and let future disciples see
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.84,0:06:41.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}Even though the cycle of reincarnation is endless,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:46.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}I have no regrets in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.60,0:06:47.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,how glorious our Soul Refining Sect once was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:51.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}Only when facing death
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:51.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}does one realize they have no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.32,0:06:57.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}I will fulfill your wish,\NI will rush forward through dust and smoke to chase the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.48,0:07:02.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}Even if the road is difficult,\NI will give it my heart and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.80,0:07:05.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mother !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:07.96,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1551,492)\fad(300,300)}Du Tian\NKid
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:08.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}Behind you, countless clear eyes\Nlook at the world you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.56,0:07:14.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}You soul will not die,\Nit will live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.88,0:07:15.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.48,0:07:18.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you willing to come with me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:18.88,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1542,536)\fad(300,300)}Yun Yimo\NFormer Soul Refining Sect Leader\NLate stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.40,0:07:33.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1547,508)\fad(300,000)}Du Tian\NAdult
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.76,0:07:42.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Du Tian,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:45.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,swear to devote this life
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:46.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,to protecting our sect !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.40,0:07:45.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}I will dare to rely on the Billion-Soul Flag
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.52,0:07:45.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}to face the wind and stirr up a storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:50.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}I'm betting on how dazzling\Nthis single spark can become.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:57.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}I have witnessed the vicissitudes of life
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:57.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}and travelled through this long night but I remain untainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:08:02.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}The promise I once broke
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:02.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}was just reignited.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:02.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.44,0:08:04.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:08.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've fulfilled my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:08.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}I hold in my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.52,0:08:08.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}your wish to see your past glory once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:11.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.08,0:08:14.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}There will always be someone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.24,0:08:14.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}to see the world you protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:14.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you willing to come with me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.24,0:08:20.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}Even if it takes countless lifetimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:25.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}Seeing mountains and rivers is like meeting people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:30.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}Let me carry on all the wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:31.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Du Tian,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.76,0:08:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,will now wipe my consciousness
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.96,0:08:35.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}that you couldn't fulfill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:36.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and become a soul fragment of the Soul Flag !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.28,0:08:40.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.08,0:08:42.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,disciple...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:43.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.08,0:08:56.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.48,0:08:57.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will fulfill my promise
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.64,0:09:00.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,to the Soul Refining Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:05.00,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1555,492)\fad(300,300)}North of the\NSuzaku Continent
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.40,0:09:15.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,We must attack
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.96,0:09:17.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,and destroy this Reincarnation Tree !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.44,0:09:29.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,At least the Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:31.84,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1529,553)\fad(300,300)}Fourth Ancestor of the\NForsaken Immortal Clan\N9-Leaf Shaman
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.16,0:09:32.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,was able to fight me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.24,0:09:34.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.68,0:09:37.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,are merely Early stage Ascendant !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.96,0:09:51.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The battle has already started.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.12,0:09:53.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,This tree was nurtured by Ancestral Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:55.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I remember that Ye Wuyou
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.56,0:09:57.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,studied a technique
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.04,0:09:59.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,to absorb their power
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:01.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,to increase your cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:06.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I like this northern one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:07.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:09.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are you doing !?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:20.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you really think
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.36,0:10:25.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,that the Forsaken Immortal Clan wouldn't be prepared ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:27.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Forsaken Immortal Clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.08,0:10:28.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,formation !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:30.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:31.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,activate !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:42.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Retreat !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:45.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to leave now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:47.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's too late !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.04,0:10:56.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fight to the death !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.00,0:10:59.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fight !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:10.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.40,0:11:12.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,What happened ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.76,0:11:13.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It stopped ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:21.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,This tastes awful !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:26.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our Ancestral Spirit cultivated for thousands of years
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:28.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you ate it !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.80,0:11:32.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,You bastard !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:34.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:36.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:37.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,hurry up !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.48,0:11:39.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Retreat !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:40.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Quick !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:41.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.76,0:11:45.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brat, I'm here !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.64,0:11:46.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Catch me if you can !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:48.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stay right there !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.36,0:12:12.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Devouring Ancestral Spirits restores cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.05,0:12:14.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,and eliminates the Warriors
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:17.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Forsaken Immortal Clan were incubating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:20.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,A worthy tribute to the first Suzaku !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:22.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,What will you do now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:26.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll find a body that matches my Spirit Root.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.36,0:12:29.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once I'm back at my prime,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:31.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll hunt down those people one by one !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.88,0:12:34.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if they're dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:37.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,their descendants will pay for their crimes !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.56,0:12:42.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:44.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know the Heaven Defying Bead
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.52,0:12:45.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a heavenly artifact
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.16,0:12:47.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,that surpasses even celestial artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:50.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since it has fused with my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.80,0:12:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can return it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.68,0:12:54.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nonsense !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:57.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,That damned bead ruined me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.24,0:12:58.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:12:59.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:03.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Situ...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.00,0:13:04.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.16,0:13:06.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.48,0:13:10.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wh..
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:13.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why are you so sentimental ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.84,0:13:15.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since I watched you grow,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:17.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're like my disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.72,0:13:19.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's just a stupid bead,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:20.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,you don't need to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.16,0:13:22.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,It makes me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.76,0:13:26.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's so funny !?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.88,0:13:28.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to thank me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.04,0:13:30.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,then find me a suitable body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:35.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Suzaku has a disciple named Qian Feng.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.96,0:13:37.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,His body might do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:39.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Suzaku's disciple...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.08,0:13:41.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nevermind,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.48,0:13:44.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,since the first Suzaku helped me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:45.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll find another.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.12,0:13:54.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.36,0:13:56.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can such a body exist ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:13:58.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once possessed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.84,0:14:01.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will match its Spirit Root.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.24,0:14:04.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a body made to be possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:05.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's this one !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.28,0:14:09.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.32,0:14:11.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's lure him to the Northern Flame Plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.48,0:14:15.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Tattoo kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:17.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,grandpa is here !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.32,0:14:22.72,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1541,472)\fad(300,300)}Northern Flame Plains
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:25.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Tattoo kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:28.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,How many times did I have to stop to wait for you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:29.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,You must hurry up !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.56,0:14:33.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,His repeated provocations
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.76,0:14:34.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,are suspicious...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.40,0:14:37.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if he hasn't refined the spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:38.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can still reclaim it !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:47.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's him !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.36,0:14:58.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.68,0:15:00.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,a restriction ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:03.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Nine-Li Fog
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.48,0:15:05.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a natural formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.96,0:15:07.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:08.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will use it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.00,0:15:10.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,to trap that Ascendant brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.28,0:15:30.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Extreme Flame Blood Light ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.36,0:15:34.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,this light causes any creature with blood
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.12,0:15:37.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,to burn, boil and die
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:40.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,within 10 breaths !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:43.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pathetic tricks !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.44,0:15:56.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Give me the Ancestral Spirit !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.92,0:16:02.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,You dare to possess me !?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get out !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.28,0:16:04.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do it now !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.56,0:16:16.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seal !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.40,0:16:20.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:22.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,With this demon child's body, an Ascendant cultivator
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.28,0:16:25.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the Ancestral Spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:26.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,it won't take long
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:28.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,for me to fully recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.12,0:16:31.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll come and find you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.44,0:16:32.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't need me to guard you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.80,0:16:33.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:36.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Nine-Li Fog will protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:38.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.28,0:16:40.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been meaning to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.56,0:16:43.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of a Ji Realm cultivator above Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.72,0:16:45.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,but you somehow are Soul Transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:47.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did you do it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.08,0:16:50.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I extracted the Ji Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.64,0:16:55.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Resisting its temptation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.56,0:16:57.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,and extracting it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.60,0:16:59.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,is remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.36,0:17:01.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.96,0:17:03.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've heard there is another method.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:05.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you obtain and refine
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.68,0:17:07.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,a Cultivation Planet Crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:09.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can breakthrough that Ji Realm bottleneck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.84,0:17:14.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if it can help Ji Realm cultivators
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:16.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,to breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:19.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if you want to leave planet Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.60,0:17:21.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will need it anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.64,0:17:22.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you mean ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.36,0:17:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before I became the Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.16,0:17:26.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I thought it was a powerful artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.08,0:17:28.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,But then, I learned that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:30.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,it is how rank 6 cultivation countries
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:33.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,control their planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.56,0:17:38.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Cultivation Alliance creates these crystals
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:41.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,and when a country reaches rank 6
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.92,0:17:44.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,they're given a planet
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:46.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,and a Cultivation Planet Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:49.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once it's activated,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,all lifeforms born on that planet
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:55.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,will have a strand of their soul stolen by the crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.04,0:17:59.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,There is an item called the Cultivation Planet Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.96,0:18:02.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's held by the successive generations of Suzakus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.04,0:18:05.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,By using a bit of lifespan,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:08.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,they can kill anyone whose soul strand is inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:11.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,During your Ascendant breakthrough,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:13.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can extract it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.68,0:18:15.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,There is no way around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.88,0:18:19.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I learned of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.20,0:18:22.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I secretly sealed our Cultivation Planet Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.16,0:18:25.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although it still absorbs soul strands,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.48,0:18:27.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,the seal prevents
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.20,0:18:29.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,anyone from controlling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.60,0:18:33.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is why planet Suzaku is in such a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.00,0:18:36.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Zhuque Zi breaks the seal,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.96,0:18:38.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will be a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.04,0:18:41.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:44.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's talk about it once I recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:46.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don’t need to worry too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.68,0:18:47.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’m still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.48,0:18:58.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cultivation Planet Crystal...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.00,0:19:01.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:03.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,will never leave my life in someone's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.36,0:19:06.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,As for Wan'er's soul strand...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.36,0:19:08.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to recover it too !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.11,0:19:33.41,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To let go of the consequences of my actions
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.41,0:19:35.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}is to ignore the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.17,0:19:37.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}like scattered ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.95,0:19:44.55,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}As destiny falls
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.79,0:19:44.55,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.55,0:19:52.15,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}It makes the mountains lose their colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:52.15,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}wither and melt into rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.59,0:19:59.71,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Who can deceive
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.35,0:19:59.71,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.03,0:20:03.03,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Countless generations
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.31,0:20:03.03,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}have tried before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.32,0:20:06.75,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}But how could I not catch my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.15,0:20:06.75,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}within my warm fingers ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.31,0:20:10.83,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're at my side when I'm alone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.83,0:20:14.15,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.91,0:20:18.11,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.47,0:20:22.31,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.31,0:20:22.31,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.47,0:20:27.27,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.03,0:20:27.27,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the rules ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:29.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To run towards you !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.03,0:20:33.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.31,0:20:37.95,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}to cut down this tribulation with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.95,0:20:41.35,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and break through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.39,0:20:46.03,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}All of that for the stars in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.48,0:20:51.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.83,0:20:55.63,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}If your soul is willing to wander,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.63,0:21:00.27,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}can I still take your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.31,0:21:00.27,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and hold them tight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.43,0:21:03.35,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.35,0:21:08.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.24,0:21:11.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I dream of destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.67,0:21:16.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the shackles of our fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.23,0:21:20.19,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.19,0:21:22.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the hardest to let go of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:26.87,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I want to be with you again
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.95,0:21:30.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}so I can look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.51,0:21:35.47,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1500}Even for a moment, it's worth it.
